{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","冰狱冷冻气"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","首次释放终极技能时，加布兽进化为钢铁加鲁鲁兽；后续释放终极技能时，钢铁加鲁鲁兽跳跃到目标格后使用“冰狱冷冻气”冻结面前大范围的敌人并使其持续失去生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在战斗中，加布兽使用“爆炎火焰弹”作为普通攻击，对敌人造成100% ATK伤害。首次释放终极技能，加布兽会进化为钢铁加鲁鲁兽，永久提升40%攻击力和25点急速，并解锁其他技能。钢铁加鲁鲁兽释放终极技能时，跳到目标格子处，对4格长3格宽的范围内的敌人喷吐“冰狱冷冻气”，将他们冻结3秒。释放期间，敌人每0.5秒失去28% + 2% ATK生命值。\n被动地，大和始终在场外处于无敌状态，并与自己的搭档并肩作战。战斗开始后以及每次释放终结技能时，大和会为搭档加油助威：使其提升15%的攻击力，持续5秒。该效果持续期间，若加布兽尚未进化为钢铁加鲁鲁兽，则每秒额外回复150点能量。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":159,"end":164,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":156,"end":168,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“冰狱冷冻气” 释放期间，敌人每0.5秒失去的生命值提高至30% + 2% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“冰狱冷冻气” 释放期间，敌人每0.5秒失去的生命值提高至32% + 2% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“冰狱冷冻气” 释放期间，敌人每0.5秒失去的生命值提高至34% + 2% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","“冰狱冷冻气” 释放期间，敌人每0.5秒失去的生命值提高至36% + 2% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","加鲁鲁战斧"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标敌人发射导弹造成高额伤害，对附近的敌人造成较低伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","从胸部发射名为“冰冻炸弹”的巨大导弹，命中时对主目标造成360% + 48% ATK伤害，对其周围1格范围内的其他敌人造成180% + 24% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对主目标造成的伤害提升至400% + 48% ATK，对其周围1格范围内的其他敌人造成的伤害提升至200% + 24% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对主目标造成的伤害提升至440% + 48% ATK，对其周围1格范围内的其他敌人造成的伤害提升至220% + 24% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对主目标造成的伤害提升至480% + 48% ATK，对其周围1格范围内的其他敌人造成的伤害提升至240% + 24% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","加鲁鲁咆哮"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升自身的攻击和急速。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","钢铁加鲁鲁兽仰天咆哮，使自身提升19% + 2.5%攻击和40点急速，持续16秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","获得的攻击力加成提升至21% + 2.5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","获得的攻击力加成提升至23% + 2.5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","获得的攻击力加成提升至25% + 2.5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升自身攻击回能，进化后，额外提升攻击回能。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击回能提升18%，进化后，额外提升12%攻击回能。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击回能提升24%，进化后，额外提升16%攻击回能。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击回能提升30%，进化后，额外提升20%攻击回能。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","慈悲交错冷库"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","发射多枚小型导弹平均攻击所有敌人，对目标及周围敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","从身体各处发射10枚小型导弹平均地飞向所有敌人。导弹命中敌人时对其周围1格范围内的所有敌人造成60% ATK伤害，每次释放本技能后，每名相同敌人累计受到4次本技能的伤害时，后续伤害均降低50%。布阵时，自身周围1格范围内每有1名友军，则本技能发射的导弹数量永久增加2枚，最多增加6枚。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":47,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","导弹命中敌人时对其周围1格范围内的所有敌人造成的伤害提升至70% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次释放本技能后，每名相同敌人累计受到4次本技能的伤害时，该敌人会被立即冻结2秒，并受到360% ATK额外伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":44,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","导弹命中敌人时对其周围1格范围内的所有敌人造成的伤害提升至80% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","加布兽在进化时，使周围的友军回复生命，自身获得攻击力加成。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","加布兽在进化时，爆发友情的羁绊，使自身和初始布阵在自身周围1格的友军每秒回复150% ATK生命值，持续8秒。该效果作用于亚古兽时，持续时间提升至12秒。每对一名友军施加该效果，自身永久提升5%攻击力，最高提升15%。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","友情徽章"]]}